# Generated outputs are committed deliberately: the documentation in out/
# is the portfolio artifact and must be readable without running anything.

# Dated value snapshots (klab.api.write_snapshot) are binary parquet, meant
# to accumulate over time, and don't serve the "readable without running
# anything" goal the rest of out/ does -- kept as a local archive only, not
# pushed to GitHub. See out/HANDOFF.md / README.md for the policy note.
out/snapshots/

